{"id":"bani","name":"Bani","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:bani"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Bani","text":"Built. (1.) 1 Chr. 6:46. (2.) One of David’s thirty-seven warriors, a Gadite (2 Sam. 23:36). (3.) Ezra 2:10; 10:29, 34, 38. (4.) A Levite who was prominent in the reforms on the return from Babylon (Neh. 8:7; 9:4, 5). His son Rehum took part in rebuilding the wall of Jerusalem (Neh. 3:17)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1137","lemma":"בָּנִי","xlit":"Bânîy","gloss":"Bani, the name of five Israelites","kjv":"Bani","count":11,"share":0.92},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":8,"share":0.67}],"verses":["2Sam.23.36","1Chr.6.46","1Chr.9.4","Ezra.2.10","Ezra.10.29","Neh.3.17","Neh.8.7","Neh.9.4","Neh.9.5","Neh.10.13","Neh.11.22","Neh.7.15"],"related":[{"id":"hodiah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.2,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"sherebiah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.176,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"abdon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"accursed","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"achbor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adrammelech","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"aharah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"}],"works":[{"work":"callaway","title":"The Religious System of the Amazulu","count":2,"chapters":[{"chapter":"Amazulu.1","count":2,"book":"Callaway","title":"Unkulunkulu; or, the Tradition of Creation"}]}]}
